blocks.en:
The baseline comparison in the main text runs five rule-based references on the same tract graph, under the same per-step move budget, capacity limits, inflow caps, and execution machinery as the LLM condition, each for ten perturbation seeds [ 43 ] :
(i) random reassignment , distributing households uniformly across tracts (the lower bound on D B ​ W D_{BW} under spatial independence);
(ii) classical Schelling with a single similarity threshold τ = 0.5 \tau=0.5 on the Queen-contiguity graph, relocating to a random feasible neighboring tract;
(iii) the same rule with best-improvement destination choice (feasible neighbor with the highest own-group share);
(iv) a per-group threshold rule calibrated from the same literature-derived archetype parameters the LLM receives, moving when the own-group share falls below the archetype’s calibrated minimum;
and (v) a logit-style utility rule scoring candidate tracts by a weighted sum of racial fit, safety, school access, transit, amenities, and housing-cost match using each archetype’s satisfaction weights.
Beyond the endpoint indices ( Table 8 ), the conditions differ in their mobility signature: the LLM-driven population’s per-step movers decline toward rest (from roughly 1,050 to 250) as the target pattern is approached, whereas every rule-based condition keeps relocating at the budget cap through step 15, and the per-group threshold rule is still rising at the end of the horizon [ 43 ] .

blocks.zh:
主文中的基线比较在相同道图上的5个基于规则的参考文献中,在相同的每步移动预算,容量限制,流入上限,以及作为LLM条件的执行机械下,每个都为10个扰动种子[43]:
(一) 随机重新分配,在空间独立的情况下,将住户统一分布在各行各业(DB W DQQBW)上;
(二) 具有单一相似性阈值的古典舍灵 τ = 0.5\tau = 0.5 在女王-连续图上,迁移到随机可行的相邻区域;
(三) 具有最佳改进目的地选择的同一规则(拥有最高自有群体份额的可行邻居);
(四) 每组阈值规则从LLM获得的相同文献衍生的原型参数校准,当自组份额低于原型校准的最小值时移动;
以及(五) 以种族合适、安全、入学机会、过境、福利设施、住房成本等加权总和,
除了终点指数(表8)之外,流动标志的条件也不同:随着目标模式的接近,LLM驱动的人群逐步移动者向休息下降(从大约1,050人下降到250人),而基于规则的每个条件都通过第15步在预算上限下迁移,而每组门槛规则在终点仍在上升[43]。

